  "title": "From Treating ATTR-CM to Living with It: A Conversation with a Cardiologist",
  "summary": "March marks Amyloidosis Awareness Month. We sat down with Charles, an 88-year-old retired cardiologist from Massachusetts, who shared what it’s like to diagnose and treat heart disease for decades and then face a diagnosis himself. His experience with transthyretin amyloid cardiomyopathy (ATTR-CM) offers a unique perspective on this underrecognized condition.",
